{
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "id": 17,
      "description": "Reading guide for this dashboard (added by the lab).",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Upstream **Istio Control Plane** dashboard for istiod 1.30.8, kept as reference next to the curated *Mesh / istiod & ztunnel*.\nistiod pushes config to 3 proxies here (2 gateway Envoys + ztunnel). Healthy: versions all 1.30.8, memory well under the 1 GiB limit,\nPush Errors empty (no NACKs), Push Time mostly in the lowest buckets. **Injection** panel stays empty: ambient mode has no sidecar injection.\nThe *Connections* panel counts Envoy xds-grpc connections (gateways only; ztunnel is not Envoy). Source & lab changes: `docs/dashboards/networking.md`."
      }
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
